# Keep secrets, VCS, and rebuildable/big dirs out of the image build context.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.local
*.env.local
/vendor/
/writable/cache/*
/writable/logs/*
/writable/debugbar/*
/writable/session/*
/build/
.phpunit.cache
.phpunit.result.cache
node_modules
.claude
.qodo
.vscode
/docs
# The generated API docs describe the whole surface — never bake them into a
# production image (would be exposed if the service is). Dev serves them via
# `php spark serve`; they stay in the repo for humans/LLMs. Belt-and-suspenders:
# the vhost also `RedirectMatch 404 ^/docs`, so even if these are ever present in
# the container they are never web-served (see docker/apache/microservice.conf).
/public/docs
tests
phpunit.dist.xml
phpcs.xml.dist
phpstan.neon
phpstan-baseline.neon
docker-compose*.yml
